INSERT INTO blocks (repo, ordinal, kind, ref, text) VALUES ('Prose', 27, 'story', '728', '- **PRS-US-D5 ✅** As the engine, world facts/lore stay consistent. *(verified by `InferenceServiceTests` and `WorldLoreTests` (30 tests: archetype/repository round-trips, plain-text entity NER), re-run 2026-10-15, 0 skipped. The 17 file-based lore checks (retired-term scans, story/tone bible, Pulse/GIDS lore, JSON validity) were deleted 2026-10-15: `engine/data` holds no canon JSON any more, so they skipped or passed over zero files. Canon is enforced in the database as law rulings and deprecated names, checked by `law_violations` and the factory gates.)*');
