INSERT INTO blocks (repo, ordinal, kind, ref, text) VALUES ('Prose', 125, 'story', '803', '- **PRS-US-H8 ⬜** As the author, *The Long Cut* (TLC; "the-long-cut") is a GLMZ medical noir in which street medic Amara "Doc Stash" Adeyemi-Kowalski inherits a dead corpo runner''s evidence implant and has 72 hours to broadcast 428 non-consensual surgical trial records before NSB and Scalpel Division destroy the evidence — and her. The story ends with Stash discovering her own name in the trial files and broadcasting the evidence anyway. Full arc, locks, register, 14-chapter spine in [docs/nodes/TLC.md](nodes/TLC.md). *Acceptance: 14 chapters + 48 beats Sonnet→Opus + logic sweep BLOCKER-free + review ≥85% + exported to R:\Desktop\EPub\MindAttic\GLMZ\TLC\.* *Factory note 2026-10-15: Review panels and scores are switched off (RFC 0014) and forbidden by the factory, so any review-score acceptance or evidence here is withdrawn/historical; done now means factory F1-F7 green and exported. State: *The Long Cut* (TLC, `the-long-cut-019f3007`): 14 units / 757 beats / 37,092 words; F2-F4 pass; F6 fails 3/14; F5 fails 13/14; F1 waiting; F7 waiting. Remaining: contributions pass, read, F1, export (PRS-T59).*');
