INSERT INTO blocks (repo, ordinal, kind, ref, text) VALUES ('Prose', 196, 'story', '853', '- **PRS-US-I6 ✅** RETIRED 2026-09-22 (RFC 0014, author ruling). The SEMANTIC-DRIFT check (`SemanticFidelityService` intent drift) no longer runs on beat save (commented out in `NodeWorkbenchService`; 1,055 findings filed, 0 applied); the `check_semantic_fidelity` MCP tool and `--check-fidelity` CLI flag no longer exist. Intent is held by the plan-first F3 gate (each Description reconciled against its prose). Note: this service was also the only path that refreshed beat embeddings; `prose --reembed --beats --slug S` covers that now. The code stays intact and restorable by design (uncomment the block in `NodeWorkbenchService`).');
